t of these is love.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>《新约·哥林多前书13:13》</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>神秘女子——周绮爱</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1ce687c9b1928e955e177f3b6296e2d8.poster.avif?t=1784716591\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1ce687c9b1928e955e177f3b6296e2d8.webm?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1ce687c9b1928e955e177f3b6296e2d8.mp4?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“没有一种<strong>爱</strong>不具备攻击性，没有无<strong>爱</strong>之恨，人类拥有<strong>爱</strong>，正是因为渴望支配与暴力。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >周绮爱，连环杀人魔手下唯一幸存者，是个极受欢迎的神秘女子，但内心的深邃与黑暗远超常人想象，似乎对你有着近乎毁灭一般的爱意。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>你的妹妹——林筱雅</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1a7899da1e0a76590f384f50977a228c.poster.avif?t=1784716591\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1a7899da1e0a76590f384f50977a228c.webm?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/1a7899da1e0a76590f384f50977a228c.mp4?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“如果可以的话，我想跟你继续是家人，我们重新开始吧。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小雅，你可爱的妹妹，因患先心病很少出门所以沉迷小说漫画，敏感早熟，对于“哥哥”与“妹妹”的感情有着特别的执念。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>你的发小——王信炜</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/bcc5c3e97d77e4284caec72e25adf5c7.poster.avif?t=1784716591\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/bcc5c3e97d77e4284caec72e25adf5c7.webm?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/bcc5c3e97d77e4284caec72e25adf5c7.mp4?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“我一直都感激你，可是你对我的好，不过就是施舍残羹剩饭而已。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的发小，学生时期曾是校园霸凌受害者，现在事业有成，性格温和情绪稳定却仍被视如牛马，似乎隐瞒了许多不为人知的秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>你（主人公）——林望川</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/d3209a555d7ba1a0fccafc1212ac694b.poster.avif?t=1784716591\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/d3209a555d7ba1a0fccafc1212ac694b.webm?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/d3209a555d7ba1a0fccafc1212ac694b.mp4?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“不偷盗，不奸淫，不陷害，不盲从……因为我真心<strong>希望</strong>这个世界能越来越美好。”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你，社畜兼理工科宅，思维缜密，同理心太强甚至会与杀人犯产生共鸣，时常做怪梦或产生幻觉，为了妹妹能活下去努力寻找真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/6edf6d823998a9b79ae0c7a218a659e9.poster.avif?t=1784716591\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/6edf6d823998a9b79ae0c7a218a659e9.webm?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/extras/6edf6d823998a9b79ae0c7a218a659e9.mp4?t=1784716591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（1）神秘江城市再起波澜，东湖湖心岛大舞台开幕。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（2）数十张精美CG图鉴，漫画分镜叙事演出。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（3）惊悚爽快的剧情体验，质疑疯批，理解疯批，成为疯批。、</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>I am sending you out like <strong>sheep among wolves</strong>. Therefore be as shrewd as snakes and as innocent as doves.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>我差你们去，如同羊进入狼群；所以你们要灵巧像蛇，驯良像鸽子。</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>《马太福音10：16》</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "《乌合之罪》是一款校园霸凌复仇X悬疑惊悚恋爱的沉浸式AVG，你（玩家）所饰演的主人公将在与外界彻底断联的诡异孤岛上历经一场极端恶意的厮杀，请找回记忆，推进剧情，抵达十四年前遗落的真相……", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/68033abe48bc263618b4e7caf9b14500e61b1ff1/header.jpg?t=1784716591", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570520/9cb